# Nehemiah Coxe, A Discourse of the Covenants (docs/sources/coxe-covenants.md). Reference only; no quotation.
# Coxe is not a phase-1 Body, so there is no Body or Holding here; the Arguments carry the evidence (PLAN_step3_minting Batch A).

<source/coxe-covenants> a gc:SourceWork ;
    rdfs:label "Nehemiah Coxe, A Discourse of the Covenants that God made with Men before the Law (London, 1681), Wing C6717"@en ;
    dcterms:bibliographicCitation "London, 1681. Wing C6717; ESTC R7196. Scan: archive.org bim_early-english-books-1641-1700_a-discourse-of-the-coven_coxe-nehemiah_1681 (leaf n = printed page + 9)." .

<source/coxe-covenants/2/10> a gc:SourceDivision ;
    rdfs:label "Coxe, ch. II §10"@en ;
    dcterms:isPartOf <source/coxe-covenants> .

<source/coxe-covenants/2/11> a gc:SourceDivision ;
    rdfs:label "Coxe, ch. II §11"@en ;
    dcterms:isPartOf <source/coxe-covenants> .

<source/coxe-covenants/5/8> a gc:SourceDivision ;
    rdfs:label "Coxe, ch. V §8"@en ;
    dcterms:isPartOf <source/coxe-covenants> .

